Capsule · Share links · Signed in
┌Share links───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│Revoke a link by its opaque id, the 32 hex characters after /s/.                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│  Opaque id  0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef                                                     │
│                                                                                                  │
│Revoke link 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef? Nobody holding it can open it again. y to revoke, n │
│to cancel.                                                                                        │
│Anyone with this URL can view what it covers:                                                     │
│http://127.0.0.1:3000/s/0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef#fragment-secret                          │
│The link stops opening at 2026-12-31T23:59:59Z.                                                   │
│To revoke it: x, Enter, then y (or `capsule share revoke 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef`).      │
│Scriptable: `capsule share create … --json`, `capsule share revoke ID --json`.                    │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
y Yes, go ahead  n No, cancel
